# Multi-Store Media · Backup · Plans (LOCKED)

Full detail: `docs/03-multistore-media-backup-plans.md`

## Scale
- Expect **600+ images per store**. Media paths `stores/{store_id}/`. Paginate; CDN; versioned URLs (no stale images).
- Plan storage quotas enforced on API.

## Master control plane
- All stores, plans, features, hosting mode, backups, restores, migrations — manageable from **Master Dashboard**.
- Store admin sees only own tenant data.

## Backup / restore / migration
- Per-store **all-in-one ZIP**: filtered SQL (`store_id`) + media files + config/manifest.
- Support: scheduled + manual backup, history, restore, migration export/import.
- Future dedicated/client hosting: same ZIP pipeline; `hosting_mode` / `db_isolation` fields ready. NO assumption that every store stays on shared forever.

## Plans
- Free / Paid / Pro / Custom (+ Master grants): each store gets **its** features, limits, backup retention, and gated updates.
- Server-side enforce — hiding UI is not enough.
